<title>POLAND: EFEKT 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>EFEKT 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.08 vs   0.06 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.14 vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.08 vs   0.08 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    2.10 vs   1.52</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.88 vs   2.98</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.25 vs   5.00</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.12 vs   1.35</p>
<p> Sales		   19.17 vs  14.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Efekt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
